---
description: Vector AI implementation rules
alwaysApply: true
---
AI proposes, policy decides, trusted software executes.
Prefer structured outputs validated by Zod.
Record provider, model, prompt version, schema version, cost, tool calls and actor.
No irreversible or high risk action without the configured approval policy.
Never let model confidence alone authorize a sensitive action.
Never give production agents unrestricted SQL, shell, filesystem, arbitrary HTTP, or secrets.
Kill switches can pause AI per client or globally. Confidence cannot override a pause.
